---
description: Match each mandatory outcome to verified capability evidence at exact edition and scope.
args:{goal:GoalContract;policy:PolicySelection;obligations:TenderRequirement[];evidence:EvidencePage[]}
returns:CapabilityMatch[]
---
Compare each required outcome with current capability records for product edition, deployment scope, certifications and dependencies. Use full, partial, none or unverified honestly. An adjacent feature, planned release or expired certificate cannot establish current compliance. Carry exact limitation and evidence refs.
